<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: missile assembly bench -->
  <DMSE_MissileAssemblyBench.label>導彈組裝台</DMSE_MissileAssemblyBench.label>
  <!-- EN: A two-by-four gantry where missiles are built from a bare airframe and the parts you choose. Finished missiles can wait on the bench for a launcher, or be sent to storage.\n\nTool cabinets and machine cabinets nearby speed up the work. Working outdoors or in uncomfortable temperatures slows it down. -->
  <DMSE_MissileAssemblyBench.description>一座二乘四的龍門組裝台，以裸彈體加上你選的部件從零組裝導彈。成品可以留在台上等發射平台來裝填，也可以送往倉儲。\n\n附近的工具櫃與機械櫃能加快工作；在戶外或溫度不適的環境施工會變慢。</DMSE_MissileAssemblyBench.description>
  
</LanguageData>